            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><i>You’ve risen through society after dealing with Eltane and saving the city, capturing the affections of the Duke’s daughter along the way. The mysterious death of a friend arouses your suspicions and once again you find yourself at the heart of conspiracy that takes you back to your home village and a meeting with your old adventuring party from your youth.</i><br><br>Curse of the Assassin is a gamebook where you control the story by deciding what action to take at key points. Use dice to determine your vitality, fitness and luck, then battle solo and with companions as you take on enemies within Orlandes... both familiar and new.<br><br>Featuring full colour artwork by Pirkka Harvala and a soundtrack by Adrian Watkins, this mystery adventure thriller races from Orlandes City through to the wilds of Orlandes, into the mines of Kern Badenach and even out to sea!",
            "about_the_game": "<i>You’ve risen through society after dealing with Eltane and saving the city, capturing the affections of the Duke’s daughter along the way. The mysterious death of a friend arouses your suspicions and once again you find yourself at the heart of conspiracy that takes you back to your home village and a meeting with your old adventuring party from your youth.</i><br><br>Curse of the Assassin is a gamebook where you control the story by deciding what action to take at key points. Use dice to determine your vitality, fitness and luck, then battle solo and with companions as you take on enemies within Orlandes... both familiar and new.<br><br>Featuring full colour artwork by Pirkka Harvala and a soundtrack by Adrian Watkins, this mystery adventure thriller races from Orlandes City through to the wilds of Orlandes, into the mines of Kern Badenach and even out to sea!",
            "short_description": "Fight, outwit and explore in Orlandes City as you uncover a conspiracy in this Gamebook Adventure where YOU control the story!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês",
